        <mxCell id="p_overview_legend_11" value="&lt;b&gt;CHÚ GIẢI SƠ ĐỒ ERD (FashionAI — 51 Bảng, 34 Enum)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;: Primary Key &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;: Foreign Key &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt;: Unique Key &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;?&lt;/b&gt;: Nullable&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Đường nét liền (———)&lt;/b&gt;: Khóa ngoại vật lý cùng miền (Hard FK trong Prisma/PostgreSQL)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Đường nét đứt (- - -)&lt;/b&gt;: Quan hệ liên miền (Overview) hoặc tham chiếu mềm / logic (Webhook, Outbox)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ký hiệu chân chim (Crow&#39;s Foot)&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;b&gt;||&lt;/b&gt; = Bắt buộc 1 &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o|&lt;/b&gt; = 0 hoặc 1 &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;o&amp;lt;&lt;/b&gt; = 0 hoặc nhiều&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;connectable=0" vertex="1" parent="1">
